376	The equivalence arises because the generation-0$\to$1 entropy drop is large ($|\Delta x| > 0.7$ for $\alpha{=}0.50$, $> 1.0$ for $\alpha{=}0.75$) relative to the null-control variability ($\sigma_0 \approx 0.03$).
